From b90a2ed913853673161a985cb02c87bbb12ad88c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: uuu <3100141307@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:24:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Verify bzImage address mappings

Register the builder for host-target verification and update dv. Specify
integer conversions, bounded arithmetic, and both setup VA/offset
conversions while preserving executable code.
The two mapping conversions explicitly trust their valid input ranges.
Limit documentation prebuilds to OSTD and its dependencies.
Include linux-bzimage in verification statistics.

Validation: builder 15 verified, 0 errors; make, release build, formatting,
and isolated caller checks passed.
